OL,3,GNEWSA'I made a career from fish and
OL,4,Achips'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old woman has urged young
OL,7,Fpeople to consider working in a chip
OL,8,Fshop as a career option.
OL,10,FGeorgia Lye, who manages Seafare
OL,11,FGuilford in Surrey, said a lot of
OL,12,Fyounger staff at her chippy "are just
OL,13,Fhere part time and don't really see it
OL,14,Fbeing a career".
OL,16,F"I was the same when I was younger,"
OL,17,Fshe added, "but the industry really
OL,18,Fencouraged me.
OL,20,F"Now I'm doing really well from it."
